{"id":"H1897","lemma":"הָגָה","transliteration":"hagah","sayIt":"ha-GAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to mutter","meaning":"1) to moan, growl, utter, muse, mutter, meditate, devise, plot, speak\n1a) (Qal)\n1a1) to roar, growl, groan\n1a2) to utter, speak\n1a3) to meditate, devise, muse, imagine\n1b) (Poal) to utter\n1c) (Hiphil) to mutter","glosses":["moan","meditate","utter","meditates","plot","proclaim"],"count":24,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"jos-1","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"meditate","kjv":"but thou shalt meditate"}},{"chapterId":"job-27","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"utter","kjv":"utter"}},{"chapterId":"psa-1","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"he meditates","kjv":"doth he meditate"}},{"chapterId":"psa-2","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"plot","kjv":"imagine"}},{"chapterId":"psa-35","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"will proclaim","kjv":"shall speak"}},{"chapterId":"psa-37","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"utters","kjv":"speaketh"}},{"chapterId":"psa-38","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"plotting","kjv":"and imagine"}},{"chapterId":"psa-63","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"I think","kjv":"and meditate"}},{"chapterId":"psa-71","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"will indeed proclaim","kjv":"also shall talk"}},{"chapterId":"psa-77","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"I will reflect","kjv":"I will meditate"}},{"chapterId":"psa-115","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"even clear","kjv":"neither speak"}},{"chapterId":"psa-143","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"I meditate","kjv":"I meditate"}},{"chapterId":"pro-8","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"will speak","kjv":"shall speak"}},{"chapterId":"pro-15","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"ponders","kjv":"studieth"}},{"chapterId":"pro-24","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"devise","kjv":"studieth"}},{"chapterId":"isa-8","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"and mutter","kjv":"and that mutter"}},{"chapterId":"isa-16","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Moan","kjv":"shall ye mourn"}},{"chapterId":"isa-31","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"or","kjv":"roaring"}},{"chapterId":"isa-33","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"will ponder","kjv":"shall meditate"}},{"chapterId":"isa-38","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"I moan","kjv":"I did mourn"}},{"chapterId":"isa-59","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"mutters","kjv":"hath muttered"}},{"chapterId":"isa-59","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"and moan","kjv":"and mourn"}},{"chapterId":"isa-59","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"and uttering","kjv":"and uttering"}},{"chapterId":"jer-48","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"I will moan","kjv":"mine heart shall mourn"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Joshua 1:8","note":"This book of the law shall not depart from your mouth, but you shall meditate on it day and night, that you may observe to do according to all that is written…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Job 27:4","note":"surely my lips will not speak unrighteousness, neither will my tongue utter deceit.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 1:2","note":"but his delight is in Yahweh’s law. On his law he meditates day and night.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 8:7","note":"For my mouth speaks truth. Wickedness is an abomination to my lips.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Isaiah 8:19","note":"When they tell you, “Consult with those who have familiar spirits and with the wizards, who chirp and who mutter,” shouldn’t a people consult with their God?…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 48:31","note":"Therefore I will wail for Moab. Yes, I will cry out for all Moab. They will mourn for the men of Kir Heres.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}